      "finite_checks": [
        {
          "check": "For H(q,p)=(q^2+p^2)/2 on a compact annular energy band in R^2, a shell of radius r has area 2 pi r and |grad H|=r, hence mu_E(1)=2 pi and dx=2 pi dE.",
